  "claim": "A supporting actor from the movie Open Grave is best known for his roll in the show Taylor Kinney starred in, a Netscape show. That show eventually spun off into \"The Originals\".",
  "evidencia": "Page: Joseph Morgan (actor). Sentence: Joseph Morgan (born Joseph Martin; 16 May 1981) is an English actor and director.\nPage: Joseph Morgan (actor). Sentence: He is best known for his role as Klaus Mikaelson in The CW show \"The Vampire Diaries\" and its spin-off \"The Originals\".\nPage: Original Vampires (The Vampire Diaries). Sentence: The Original vampires, in the universe of \"The Vampire Diaries\" and \"The Originals\", are a family of vampires from which all current vampires descend, as well as being the most powerful and indestructible of their kind.\nPage: Open Grave. Sentence: Open Grave is a 2013 post-apocalyptic zombie-like suspense film directed by Gonzalo López-Gallego, starring Sharlto Copley as Jonah Cooke and Thomas Kretschmann, Joseph Morgan, Erin Richards, Josie Ho, in supporting roles.\nPage: Taylor Kinney. Sentence: He is known for playing Mason Lockwood in \"The Vampire Diaries\", Jared in \"Zero Dark Thirty\", and Lieutenant Kelly Severide in \"Chicago Fire\", \"Chicago P.D.\" and \"Chicago Med\".",
