        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "078b25be-b2fe-577d-9ec5-253d0f6985a7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joseph Morgan, Taylor Kinney, Sharlto Copley, Thomas Kretschmann, Erin Richards, Josie Ho, Gonzalo López-Gallego\n- Works: The Vampire Diaries, The Originals, Open Grave, Zero Dark Thirty, Chicago Fire, Chicago P.D., Chicago Med\n- Concepts: Original vampires, Klaus Mikaelson, Mason Lockwood, Jonah Cooke\n\nFacts:\n- Joseph Morgan was born as Joseph Martin on 16 May 1981 and is an English actor and director.\n- Joseph Morgan is best known for playing Klaus Mikaelson in The CW series The Vampire Diaries and its spin-off The Originals.\n- In the universes of The Vampire Diaries and The Originals, the Original vampires are a vampire family from which all current vampires descend and are the most powerful and indestructible vampires.\n- Open Grave is a 2013 post-apocalyptic zombie-like suspense film directed by Gonzalo López-Gallego.\n- In Open Grave, Sharlto Copley stars as Jonah Cooke, and Thomas Kretschmann, Joseph Morgan, Erin Richards, and Josie Ho appear in supporting roles.\n- Taylor Kinney is known for playing Mason Lockwood in The Vampire Diaries, Jared in Zero Dark Thirty, and Lieutenant Kelly Severide in Chicago Fire, Chicago P.D., and Chicago Med.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
